WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.500
<v Dev Maheshwari>Okay, let's get through Verdant Kitchens production planning. Main thing today is locking the schedule for the launch films and the website.</v>

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:31.800
<v Ritika Sen>Storyboard is at version two. I still want to rework the ending, the product reveal feels rushed. I will send the revised storyboard by Thursday.</v>

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Dev Maheshwari>Good. And just to confirm, launch is fifteenth of November, so films have to be delivered at least a week before that.</v>

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:28.900
<v Arjun Nair>On the website side, we have the homepage and the recipe pages designed. The checkout flow is not started. I think the logo files are with the agency, but I have not actually checked.</v>

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:41.400
<v Dev Maheshwari>Someone needs to get those logo files before the design review. Let's not block on it, but it needs an owner.</v>

00:05:52.000 --> 00:06:10.700
<v Priya Nair>For the film music, the client liked the reference track. Who is going to approve the final cut on the client side? Ananya or Kabir?</v>

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:20.300
<v Dev Maheshwari>Good question, I do not know. Let's keep that open for now.</v>

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:52.200
<v Priya Nair>The reference track needs a licence. I will check with legal and revert on the music licence, I cannot say how long it takes.</v>

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:26.400
<v Dev Maheshwari>Actually, the client called this morning. They want to move the launch to the twentieth of November. Let's go with the twentieth then.</v>

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:38.100
<v Arjun Nair>That gives us a bit more room on checkout. I will have the checkout flow designed by the twenty-eighth of October.</v>

00:24:40.900 --> 00:25:02.000
<v Ritika Sen>One more thing, the films should feel really premium, same as the brand repositioning. I am not sure what that means for the colour grading yet.</v>

00:31:15.000 --> 00:31:30.600
<v Dev Maheshwari>Right. So decisions: launch is the twentieth, films delivered a week earlier, and Arjun owns checkout. We reconvene next Tuesday.</v>
